d did2s_plot - Event-study plot after did2s
d Jerg Gutmann
d Version 0.2.0 (beta). Plots did2s event-study coefficients with confidence intervals in the same layout as dcdh_plot and lpdid_plot; optionally a post-treatment block, averages, joint tests and p-values. Requires Stata 16 or newer and did2s.
